#, fuzzy
msgid ""
msgstr ""#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:1
msgid "triton.autotune"
msgstr "triton.autotune"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:7
msgid "用于自动调优 triton.jit 函数的装饰器。"
msgstr "A decorator for automatically tuning triton.jit functions."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:22
msgid ""
"注：当所有配置都被解析时，内核将运行多次。也就是说内核更新的任何值都会进行多次更新。为了避免这种不希望出现的行为，可以使用 "
"`reset_to_zero` 参数，该参数会在运行任何配置之前将提供的张量值重置为零。"
msgstr ""
"Note: When all configurations are evaluated, the kernel will run multiple "
"times. This means any values updated by the kernel will be updated multiple "
"times. To avoid this undesirable behavior, use the `reset_to_zero` "
"parameter, which resets the provided tensor values to zero before running "
"any configuration."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:23
msgid ""
"注：如果环境变量 `TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING` 设置为 `\"1\"`，Triton 会在每次自动调优内核后向标准输出 "
"(stdout) 打印一条消息，包括自动调优所花费的时间和最佳配置。"
msgstr ""
"Note: If the environment variable `TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING` is set to "
"`\"1\"`, Triton will print a message to stdout after each autotuning kernel,"
" including the time spent on autotuning and the best configuration."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:25
msgid "**参数：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:27
msgid "`configs (list[triton.Config])` - `triton.Config` 对象列表。"
msgstr "`configs (list[triton.Config])` - A list of `triton.Config` objects."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:28
msgid "`key (list[str])` - 参数名列表，当值发生改变时将触发对所有配置的解析。"
msgstr ""
"`key (list[str])` - A list of parameter names; when their values change, all"
" configurations will be evaluated."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:29
msgid "`prune_configs_by (dict)` - 修剪配置的函数字典。包含以下字段："
msgstr ""
"`prune_configs_by (dict)` - A dictionary of functions for pruning "
"configurations. Contains the following fields:"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:30
msgid "`'perf_model'`: 性能模型，用于预测不同配置的运行时间，返回运行时间"
msgstr ""
"`'perf_model'`: A performance model for predicting the runtime of different "
"configurations, returns the runtime"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:31
msgid "`'top_k'`: 要进行基准测试的配置数量"
msgstr "`'top_k'`: The number of configurations to benchmark"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:32
msgid ""
"`'early_config_prune'`（可选）: 用于提前修剪配置的函数（例如，`num_stages`）。它接收 `configs: "
"List[Config]` 作为输入，并返回修剪后的配置"
msgstr ""
"`'early_config_prune'` (optional): A function for early pruning of "
"configurations (e.g., `num_stages`). It takes `configs: List[Config]` as "
"input and returns the pruned configuration list"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:33
msgid "`reset_to_zero (list[str])` - 参数名称列表，将在任何配置解析之前被重置为零。"
msgstr ""
"`reset_to_zero (list[str])` - A list of parameter names that will be reset "
"to zero before any configuration is evaluated."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:34
msgid "`restore_value (list[str])` - 参数名称列表，这些参数的值将在解析任何配置之后恢复。"
msgstr ""
"`restore_value (list[str])` - A list of parameter names whose values will be"
" restored after any configuration is evaluated."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:35
msgid ""
"`pre_hook (lambda args, reset_only)` - 一个将在调用内核之前被调用的函数。该参数会覆盖 "
"`reset_to_zero` 和 `restore_value` 的默认 `pre_hook`。"
msgstr ""
"`pre_hook (lambda args, reset_only)` - A function to be called before "
"invoking the kernel. This parameter overrides the default `pre_hook` of "
"`reset_to_zero` and `restore_value`."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:36
#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:39
msgid "`args`：传递给内核的参数列表"
msgstr "`args`: list of arguments passed to the kernel"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:37
msgid "`reset_only`：一个布尔值，表示 `pre_hook` 是否仅用于重置值，而没有对应的 `post_hook`"
msgstr ""
"`reset_only`: A boolean indicating whether `pre_hook` is only used to reset "
"values without a corresponding `post_hook`"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:38
msgid ""
"`post_hook (lambda args, exception)` - 一个将在调用内核之后被调用的函数。该参数会覆盖 "
"`restore_value` 的默认 `post_hook`。"
msgstr ""
"`post_hook (lambda args, exception)` - A function to be called after "
"invoking the kernel. This parameter overrides the default `post_hook` of "
"`restore_value`."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:40
msgid "`exception`：在出现编译或运行时错误情况下，由内核引发的异常"
msgstr ""
"`exception`: The exception raised by the kernel in case of compilation or "
"runtime errors"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:41
msgid "`warmup (int)` - 传递给基准测试的预热时间（以毫秒为单位），默认值为 25。"
msgstr ""
"`warmup (int)` - The warmup time passed to the benchmark (in milliseconds), "
"default is 25."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:42
msgid "`rep (int)` - 传递给基准测试的重复时间（以毫秒为单位），默认值为 100。"
msgstr ""
"`rep (int)` - The repetition time passed to the benchmark (in milliseconds),"
" default is 100."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/autotune.md:43
msgid "`use_cuda_graph (bool)` - 是否使用 CUDA Graph 进行性能测量（默认为 `False`）。"
msgstr ""
"`use_cuda_graph (bool)` - Whether to use CUDA Graph for performance "
"measurement (default is `False`)."
